# Membership summary

Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-98101dbc57500b644bf6342da673e90e33127e64 "Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense [[cite:obs-278d9874403001ff736f19c22aae46b1e390c2c0 "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense."]].
